### RISE with SAP – The all-in-one package ☁️

**SAP Activate** = the step-by-step plan (has existed for a long time)  
**RISE with SAP** = a package that contains EVERYTHING needed to move to the cloud

**The 6 phases (SAP Activate):**

| Phase | Meaning | Restaurant analogy |
|---|---|---|
| **Discover** | Explore possibilities | "I want to open a restaurant, what's out there?" |
| **Prepare** | Assemble team and plan | Hire a chef, plan the budget |
| **Explore** | Test and decide | Taste-test the menu, choose decor |
| **Realize** | Build for real | Renovate the venue, train staff |
| **Deploy** | Go live | Opening day! |
| **Run** | Daily operations | Running the restaurant every day |

**RISE with SAP includes:**
- The system itself (Private Cloud)
- **SAP Cloud ALM** – tool for managing project tasks (included for free)
- **Embedded Launch Onboarding Expert** – an SAP employee who helps your team
- Extra checkpoints (Q-Gates)

> **Analogy:** SAP Activate is the recipe. RISE with SAP is a meal kit – you get the recipe, all the ingredients, and a chef to help you.

**Tools in the RISE with SAP Methodology:**

| Tool | What it does | Analogy |
|---|---|---|
| **Clean Core Q-Gate** | Checkpoint + meeting at the end of each phase | Exam before the next course |
| **Clean Core Reports** | Reports showing how clean the project is | Grade documentation |
| **Clean Core Runbook** | Measures performance against KPIs, list of customizations | Diary that keeps track |
| **RISE Methodology Report** | Overall status report | Summary for the boss |

